  },
  {
   "text": "precise coding tasks*: `temperature=0.6, top_p=0.95, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=0.0,",
   "source": "TokenTinkerer/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive-TTQ-GGUF README.md:L152"
  },
  {
   "text": "For comparison, their card suggests two other presets: `temperature=1.0, presence_penalty=1.5` for",
   "source": "TokenTinkerer/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive-TTQ-GGUF README.md:L156"
  },
  {
   "text": "thinking mode on general tasks (hotter, more variety), and `temperature=0.7, top_p=0.80` for",
   "source": "TokenTinkerer/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive-TTQ-GGUF README.md:L157"
  },
  {
   "text": "non-thinking mode. Swap to either if it suits your use; these quants are not tuned to a sampler.",
   "source": "TokenTinkerer/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive-TTQ-GGUF README.md:L158"
  },
  {
